[[div class="jean duplo space opaque large oheader" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 0%, rgba(50, 96, 110, 1) 50%, rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 100%);"]]

[T+55:24:41] — Eng. Jana Kourin

[[div class="large space vanta"]]

{{DIAGNOSTICS: Suit power low (40%).}}



{{VITALS: Moderately high stress markers and anxiety response. Breathing exercises recommended.}}

[[/div]]

----



Oh, fuck off. //[Takes several quick, agitated breaths in rapid succession, then groans loudly.]//



I don’t buy it. I asked him about the river of glass, and the jungle where I went looking on the first day. Nothing. 



I asked if he remembered the academy. He just stared at me. No recognition, his eyes were //empty.//



And the others are giving //me// flak for pressing him, as if he's just gonna snap out of it. It's bullshit! I... I //know// Harrow, and that's not... He wouldn't... 



//[Stops, then continues after a few seconds, voice hushed.]// Then, I asked about his pod landing... He said it was "uneventful." //Uneventful?//  



We found the wreckage of his pod shredded to pieces! 



He's lying. It's //not him.// 



And now he's about to lead us below ground, to who knows where? What are we doing?! 

[[/div]]

