[[div class="jean duplo space opaque large oheader" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 0%, rgba(50, 96, 110, 1) 50%, rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 100%);"]]

[T+55:28:32] — Combined Suit Audio Feed

[[div class="large space vanta"]]

{{DIAGNOSTICS: All channels open. High ambient EM interference.}}



{{VITALS: All present crewmembers display a mixture of tachycardia, hypertension, and other moderate stress markers. Rest and relaxation is recommended.}}

