[[div class="jean duplo space opaque large oheader" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 0%, rgba(50, 96, 110, 1) 50%, rgba(57, 109, 125, 1) 100%);"]]

[T+56:02:12] — Cmdr. Egan Rhames

[[div class="large space vanta"]]

{{DIAGNOSTICS: Emergency.}}



{{VITALS: Adrenaline spike. Moderate stress.}}

