REVENANT confirms. Shuttle vector is nominal for the FLS //Grace//. Extraction is T-minus sixteen hours. We're getting out of here. 



Crew is packing light. Just the samples and the relay crate. The air is beginning to feel impossibly heavy, almost suffocating. Our suit filtration systems are running on fumes, whatever is left to use.



To that end, I have to conserve power. 



Rhames, out.

